  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICTD - improving tax systems in developing countries through accessible high quality evidence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improved tax systems in developing countries that support pro-poor economic growth, advance equity for poor people, increase revenue, and improve accountability. 
The expected effects for the target group of the Project are that high quality evidence is accessed by governments of developing countries, other stakeholders and donors, multilaterals, &amp; civil society organisations, who then modify their practices, policies or programmes</narrative>
  </description>
